  "result": "## Summary\n\nI've successfully implemented the bulk discount feature for the invoicing system. Here's what was accomplished:\n\n**Implementation in src/totals.js:**\n- Added `lineBulkDiscount(line)` helper function - calculates 2.5% discount for lines with qty >= 10, applied after line/tier discount\n- Added `lineAmountAfterAllDiscounts(line)` helper - calculates the final amount after both discounts\n- Updated `lineVAT(line)` - now calculates VAT on the amount after both line discount AND bulk discount\n- Updated `invoiceTotals(invoice)` - now includes bulk discount in the total discount field\n\n**Key Features:**\n- Bulk discount only applies to lines with qty >= 10\n- Bulk discount is 2.5% of the amount remaining after the line's own (or tier) discount\n- Bulk discount stacks with existing discounts (line discount and tier discount)\n- VAT is calculated AFTER both discounts\n- invoiceTotals correctly includes bulk discount in the discount total\n\n**Tests in test/totals.test.js:**\nAdded 15+ comprehensive tests covering:\n- Basic bulk discount calculation\n- Stacking with line discounts and tier discounts  \n- Boundary cases (qty = 9 vs qty = 10)\n- Multiple lines with/without bulk discount\n- High quantity bulk discount scenarios\n- Bulk discount with different VAT rates\n- Formula verification\n- Edge cases with 0% VAT\n\nThe implementation is complete and working correctly. The bulk discount feature integrates seamlessly with the existing discount system and properly affects VAT calculations.",
